            </note>
            <note corresp="#d141-f3" n="3" xml:id="d141-f3-content">
                <p>Canceled type in the source text represented a proposed deletion.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d141-f4" n="4" xml:id="d141-f4-content">
                <p>The words printed in italics throughout this document, except for paragraph
                    headings, were underscored in the source text to represent proposed
                    additions.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
